---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Thesis Video Series | Danish West Indies"
	description="Watch our master thesis video series on the economic history of the Danish West Indies. Featuring Anton Meier Ebsen Jørgensen."
>
	<div class="page-container animate-fade-in">
		<header class="video-header">
			<a href="/thesis" class="back-link">← Back to Thesis Portal</a>
			<span class="label">Academic Portal</span>
			<h1>Thesis Video Series</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Exploring the Economic History of the Danish West Indies</p>
			
			<div class="promotional-links">
				<p>Presented by the authors. For more historical economics content, connect with Anton:</p>
				<div class="link-buttons">
					<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@thewanderingeconomist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-promo youtube">
						<span class="icon">▶</span> Subscribe on YouTube
					</a>
					<a href="https://www.antonebsen.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-promo website">
						<span class="icon">🌐</span> Visit AntonEbsen.dk
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<section class="video-grid-section">
			<div class="section-header">
				<h2>Upcoming Episodes</h2>
				<p class="section-desc">We are currently recording our thesis breakdown series. Check back soon for the premiere, or subscribe on YouTube to be notified when the first episodes drop.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="video-grid">
				<!-- Placeholder Video 1 -->
				<div class="video-card">
					<div class="video-wrapper placeholder-wrapper">
						<!-- INSTRUCTIONS: To add a real video, replace the <div class="video-placeholder"> block below with your YouTube embed iframe code. Make sure the iframe has class="yt-iframe" if needed, though standard width="100%" height="100%" in inline styles works well. -->
						<div class="video-placeholder">
							<span class="recording-icon">🔴</span>
							<span>Recording in Progress</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="video-info">
						<span class="episode-tag">Episode 1</span>
						<h3>The Colonial Ledger: Data and Erasure</h3>
						<p>An introduction to our thesis methodology. How did the Danish bureaucracy reduce human lives to taxable assets, and how can we resurrect those identities?</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Placeholder Video 2 -->
				<div class="video-card">
					<div class="video-wrapper placeholder-wrapper">
						<div class="video-placeholder">
							<span class="recording-icon">🔴</span>
							<span>Recording in Progress</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="video-info">
						<span class="episode-tag">Episode 2</span>
						<h3>The Sugar Beet Threat</h3>
						<p>Analyzing the collapse of the Caribbean sugar economy and the rise of European subsidized sugar beets that altered the course of the colony.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Placeholder Video 3 -->
				<div class="video-card">
					<div class="video-wrapper placeholder-wrapper">
						<div class="video-placeholder">
							<span class="recording-icon">🔴</span>
							<span>Recording in Progress</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="video-info">
						<span class="episode-tag">Episode 3</span>
						<h3>Mortality and Capital Loss</h3>
						<p>A deep dive into the horrific economic calculus of the "seasoning" period and the disease environment of St. Croix.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-container {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
	}

	.video-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
		border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
		position: relative;
	}

	.back-link {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		transition: color var(--transition-fast);
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.label {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
	}

	.video-header h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.subtitle {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
	}

	/* Promotional Links */
	.promotional-links {
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.05);
		border: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: var(--space-lg);
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.promotional-links p {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.link-buttons {
		display: flex;
		gap: var(--space-md);
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.btn-promo {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: bold;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.youtube {
		background-color: #FF0000;
		color: #FFF;
	}

	.youtube:hover {
		background-color: #CC0000;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3);
	}

	.website {
		background-color: var(--color-accent);
		color: var(--color-bg);
	}

	.website:hover {
		background-color: #d6b88a;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.3);
	}

	/* Video Section */
	.section-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
	}

	.section-header h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-size: 2rem;
	}

	.section-desc {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.video-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
		gap: var(--space-xl);
	}

	.video-card {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 8px;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
	}

	.video-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
		border-color: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.4);
	}

	/* Aspect Ratio 16:9 for Video/Placeholder */
	.video-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 aspect ratio */
		background: #000;
	}

	.video-wrapper iframe, .video-placeholder {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: none;
	}

	.video-placeholder {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #0a0a0a 100%);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		letter-spacing: 1px;
	}

	.recording-icon {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		animation: pulse 2s infinite;
	}

	@keyframes pulse {
		0% { opacity: 0.3; }
		50% { opacity: 1; }
		100% { opacity: 0.3; }
	}

	.video-info {
		padding: var(--space-md);
	}

	.episode-tag {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1);
		padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 3px;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
	}

	.video-info h3 {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	.video-info p {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.back-link {
			position: static;
			display: block;
			margin-bottom: 1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
